      "source_description": "UC6: Excalibur address records (EE/TMUK). 43 COMMA-delimited fields, headerless -- the supplied brief states pipe for every source, but this feed contains no pipes at all (see docs/UC6/FRAMEWORK_CAPABILITY_MAP.md section 3.1). Two record variants place the address in fields 18-20 or 19-22; both are handled in the PAF normalisation SQL.",
      "source_type": "autoloader",
      "target_catalog": "{{catalog}}",
